              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naphtali did not drive out the inhabitants of Beth-shemesh, or the inhabitants of Beth-anath, but dwelt among the Canaanites, the inhabitants of the land; nevertheless the inhabitants of Beth-shemesh and of Beth-anath became subject to forced labor for them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.33"
            ]
          }
        }
